{"id":"2e16c082a622ccd3","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-strengthpreorder.md","title":"Variable strength is a preorder","display":"thm-strengthpreorder — Variable strength is a preorder","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-strengthpreorder","aliases":["27-thm-strengthpreorder"],"display":"thm-strengthpreorder — Variable strength is a preorder","depends_on":["[[27-df-regular]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-strengthpreorder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-strengthpreorder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-strengthpreorder — Variable strength is a preorder"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" href=\"?note=6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" title=\"27-df-regular\">27-df-regular</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\succeq_f\">\\(\\succeq_f\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" href=\"?note=6ae49270bb9c0b4f\" title=\"27-df-regular\">27-df-regular</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(i\\succeq_f i)\\ \\land\\ \\forall i,j,k\\in[n]\\;\\left[(i\\succeq_f j\\land j\\succeq_f k)\\longrightarrow i\\succeq_f k\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(i\\succeq_f i)\\ \\land\\ \\forall i,j,k\\in[n]\\;\\left[(i\\succeq_f j\\land j\\succeq_f k)\\longrightarrow i\\succeq_f k\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;\\left[(i\\succeq_f j\\land j\\succeq_f i)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(\\left[y_i=x_j\\land y_j=x_i\\land\\forall k\\in[n]\\setminus\\{i,j\\}\\;(y_k=x_k)\\right]\\longrightarrow f(x)=f(y)\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;\\left[(i\\succeq_f j\\land j\\succeq_f i)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(\\left[y_i=x_j\\land y_j=x_i\\land\\forall k\\in[n]\\setminus\\{i,j\\}\\;(y_k=x_k)\\right]\\longrightarrow f(x)=f(y)\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 §8.1，Theorems 8.1、8.2，印刷 pp.352–353／PDF pp.376–377；已核对陈述和证明。反身性直接成立；传递性按中间变量的值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 分两次交换比较。两个方向的强度比较合起来恰好是交换坐标不改变函数值。</li>\n<li>这两式不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 为正函数；regular 类额外的正性不应误加到强度关系本身。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"6ae49270bb9c0b4f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-regular]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-regular","status":"resolved","id":"6ae49270bb9c0b4f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$[n]$ 与 $\\succeq_f$ 见 [[27-df-regular]]。$x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\succeq_f","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(i\\succeq_f i)\\ \\land\\ \\forall i,j,k\\in[n]\\;\\left[(i\\succeq_f j\\land j\\succeq_f k)\\longrightarrow i\\succeq_f k\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;\\left[(i\\succeq_f j\\land j\\succeq_f i)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(\\left[y_i=x_j\\land y_j=x_i\\land\\forall k\\in[n]\\setminus\\{i,j\\}\\;(y_k=x_k)\\right]\\longrightarrow f(x)=f(y)\\right)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1264,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-564","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-strengthpreorder|thm-strengthpreorder — Variable strength is a preorder]]"},{"id":"28287ff9da7cda0e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$[n],S_n,\\succeq_f,\\mathrm{Regular}_n,\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$ 见 [[27-df-regular]]，强度预序性质见 [[27-thm-strengthpreorder]]。"}],"outgoing":["6ae49270bb9c0b4f"]}